## Gather and Grow 2026

Gather and Grow is a day of virtual learning on Friday, December 4, 2026, from 9:15 AM to 3:00 PM. A partnership of library systems, including OWWL Library System, puts it on under the theme "Sowing Seeds of Inspiration, Growing Stronger Libraries." Registration is open to every partner system's libraries, and OWWL has 18 registrations so far. I would love for our system to be one of the highest represented, so please share this with your staff and trustees and see how many we can get to attend.

The day opens with a keynote by Eric Rosswood, "The Ripple Effect: How Small, Intentional Acts of Inclusion Can Have Big, Meaningful Impacts." Three one-hour sessions follow, and each one offers three tracks to choose from.

