- Teen Amazing Race
- Navigating AI Hype in Small Public Libraries

### Track 3, Advocacy and Access

- Your Library Accessibility Action Plan
- Serving Neurodivergent Patrons
- Library Advocacy

Please [register through LibCal](https://stls.libcal.com/calendar/events/GatherGrow-2026). The [event flyer](https://owwl-library-system.github.io/briefing/assets/images/uploads/G%26G%202026%20Flyer.pdf) is available to share and print, and more information is at [learning.stls.org](https://learning.stls.org/).

